  "summary_text": "Intro call with Verde Retail's Head of Retail Operations. Franchise and wholesale sales are managed in WhatsApp groups and spreadsheets. A previous BI project failed on adoption. No budget yet; Camila will read a case study after Black Friday, with no date and no meeting booked.",
  "summary_markdown": "Intro call with Verde Retail's Head of Retail Operations. Franchise and wholesale sales are managed in WhatsApp groups and spreadsheets. A previous BI project failed on adoption. No budget yet; Camila will read a case study after Black Friday, with no date and no meeting booked.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Camila, thanks for taking the call on a Monday afternoon.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:09Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Hi Ana. Sorry if I sound tired, we're three weeks from Black Friday and the stores are going crazy.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:17Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "I can imagine. I'll keep it focused. You reached out about managing your franchise network, right?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:19Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:25Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Yes. We have thirty-eight own stores, but the growth is in the franchise and wholesale channel: forty franchisees and around two hundred wholesale buyers.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:26Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:35Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Today all of that runs on WhatsApp groups and spreadsheets. When a franchisee complains or a buyer asks for a reorder, it's lost in a chat somewhere.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:44Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:00:54Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "So what you'd want is one place where your team sees every franchisee and wholesale buyer, with their orders, visits and complaints?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:01:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:01:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Yes, that's exactly it. One place for the franchisees and the wholesale buyers, instead of fifty WhatsApp groups.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:01:21Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:01:28Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "How big is Verde overall?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:02:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:02:42Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "About one thousand two hundred employees, most of them in the stores.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:02:44Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:02:49Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "And how many people would use a CRM?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:04:15Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:04:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, I don't know yet. Maybe the regional managers, maybe more. I'd have to think about it.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:04:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:04:27Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "One thing I should tell you. Two years ago we bought a BI tool and it failed. It was too complicated and the store teams stopped using it after a month. I can't go through that again.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:06:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:06:44Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "That's important to know. Simplicity would be a requirement, then.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:06:52Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:06:56Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Is there a budget for this kind of project?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:08:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:08:13Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Not right now. There's no budget allocated for this yet, it would have to go into next year's plan.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:08:14Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:08:21Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "By the way, my daughter started at the same school as your colleague's son, small world.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:11:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:11:35Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Really? That's funny, I'll tell him.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:11:36Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:11:38Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "We work with a fashion retailer with a franchise model very similar to yours. I'll send you our product overview and that case study.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:14Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Please do. I'll read it with my team after Black Friday.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:18Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:22Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Would it make sense to book a short demo for the end of November?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:25Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:30Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Let's not book anything yet. Send me the case study first and I'll come back to you. No rush, honestly.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:31Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:39Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Understood, no pressure.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:42Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:16:43Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Camila Rocha"
      },
      "text": "Thanks Ana, have a good week.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-02T17:27:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-02T17:27:42Z"
    }
  ]
}
